define m = Character("Mina")
define j = Character("Jose")
define r = Character("Ruby")
define p = Character("Proffessor Tengen Ruise")
define v = Character("Veronica")

label start:
    "I'm in love with someone who's in love with someone"
    "And I know it sounds strange"
    "But I can't go away, it's like a toxin that has infected my mind"
    "Her name is...."
    "Mina"
    "My childhood friend who is a tomboy secretly pretending to be a guy"
    "And her boyfriend, or should I say girlfriend"
    "Is a femboy secretly pretending to be a girl"
    "And I know what you must be thinking, such a cute romantic twist"
    "Well it was....."

    scene black
    show text "Before I killed them both" at truecenter
    with dissolve 
    pause(5)
    hide text
    with dissolve

    show text "This all begins 4 years ago" at truecenter 
    with dissolve
    pause(5)
    hide text 
    with dissolve
    hide scene black

#start of past live
    m "Ruby, wake up"
    m "We are late for school"

    "I remember this voice"
    #she opens her eyes and sees Mina

    r "Yeah Yeah I'm waking up"
    "I love waking up late so her face is the first thing I see every morning"
    "She is just so cute"

    m "COME ON!!!"
    m "Why do you sleep so late everyday, you know I hate being late for school"
    m "You have to wake up ealier, for me"

    r "Okay, now can you get out so I can change"

    m "Nooo, you might go back to sleep"

    r "But I can't change with you inside"

    m "Why?, I've seen you naked before"

    r "That's different we were young"
    "To be honest, this is exactly what I wanted"
    "Somethng about her eyes looking at me makes me happy"

    show text "You finished changing" at truecenter
    with dissolve 
    pause(5)
    hide text
    with dissolve

    r "I'm done let's go"
    
    m "Okay, hurry up we late"

    r "I get it let's go"

    "We began walking to school together like we usually do"
    "And amidst all the endless talking, I simply found myself looking at her face"
    "Her beauty is more important than these dumb conversations"
    "Until something she said caught my attention"

    m "I have a girlfriend now"

    r "WHAAT!!!"

    m "Why are you so suprised, we are university students"
    m "I was bound to find love one of these day"
    m "Or are you surprised that it is a girl"

    menu:
        "I am suprised":
            jump suprised
        "Not really suprised":
            jump nsuprised

label suprised:
    #Tsundere Path
    r "What do you expect"
    r "You suddenly come out as lesbian and you don't even tell me"
    "To make it worse it is not even with me"
    "The moment the door to her heart opened it seems like it has already been given to someone else"
    "I need to find out who it is"
    r "You could have at least told me about her"

    m "I'm sorry, it happened all so sudden"
    m "And you're always either in the gym or playing video games in your room all nght"
    m "You barely have time for me, even to listen to what I say"

    "She is not entirely wrong I have been spending so much time on myself that I completely forgot about her"
    "And we used to be inseperable back then"
    "That is probably why she went and started dating someone"
    "Maybe if I become attatched again she might return to me"
    "And hopefully even date me"

    r "I honestly never thought you would be the type to date a girl"
    r "But with your tomboy appearance I guess you can't just go date a guy can you?"

    m "You're right, It would look weird if I started dating a guy"
    m "Many people think I'm a guy and dating a guy would mean I'm gay"
    m "And you of all people know how insecure I can be about my gender"

    r "I apologise for bringing this up, It just felt strange so I had to ask"
    r "I did not mean to offend you or anything like that"
    
    m "I understand"
    m "Also do you want to meet her?"

    menu:
        "Yes":
            jump t1
        "No":
            jump u1

label nsuprised:
    #Understanding Path
    "Have I not been listening to her nowadays"
    "I think that I've been to busy with the gym and playing 7 rings all night"
    "That I completely forgot about her, That she is my friend...."
    "And the girl that I love"

    r "Not really, I mean I don't blame you"
    r "I spend soo much time with the gym and games that I have completely forgotten about our relationship"

    m "Aww that is super cute"
    m "At least you realise your mistake, and maybe can start waking up earlier so we can get to class on time"

    r "Yes mam"

label t1:
    r "Yes I would love to"

    m "AHHHH!!!"

    r "What?"

    m "All ths talking has made me forget about class"
    m "Hurry let's run"

    r "Oh not again"
    "I began running as fast as I could"
    "Making sure that she was right behind me so that I do not leave her"
    "I'm suprised being a tomboy for so long has not made her fast or athletc in any sense"
    "But I do find that about her cute"
    r "Ok slow down we have finally arrived"

    m "WE ARE STILL AT THE GATE!!!"
    m "We need to make sure we get inside the class"
    m "Now pick up the pace"

    "We began running down the hall to make it to our class and then I spotted someone"
    "It was a small petite girl coming out of the ladies bathroom"
    "But something felt wrong"
    "I've spent my life with Mina so I know how to identify a person's gender easily"
    "And according to me..... That was not a girl"
    "THAT WAS A GUY!!!"
    "But I was already late for class so I'll confront him afterwards"

    show text "They finally reached the class where their lecturer was waiting for them outside the door" at truecenter
    with dissolve 
    pause(5)
    hide text 
    with dissolve

    p "I see...."
    p "Late as usual are we, Mina and Ruby"

    r "Sorry prof we ran into some issues while coming here"

    p "Let me guess, you overslept again"

    "Ahh spot on"
    "But if I tell him that he may force me to stay afterclass"
    "And I have work and gym"

    r "No sir, we got lost in our conversation while walking we forgot to keep track of time"

    p "You're excuses will not work this time Ruby"
    p "Enter both of you but I need to see you after my class"

    r "Why?"

    m "Yes sir we will"

    r "Mina!!"

    m "Just shut up already bro"

    "Bro?"
    "I guess she is already into her male character" 
    r "Of course sir"

    p "Good now get in you are delaying class"

    show text "The lesson goes on for the next 5 hours and has finally ended" at truecenter
    with dissolve
    pause(5)
    hide text
    with dissolve

    show text "You and Mina report to the Professor" at truecenter 
    with dissolve
    pause(5)
    hide text 
    with dissolve

    r "The greatest professor to ever teach humans in all of history"
    r "We are at your service"

    p "Mina you can leave"

    m "Why sir?"

    p "Don't ask questions, and your lady is awaiting your presence outside"

    m "SIR!!"

    "Is that her girlfriend?"

    p "And as for you, Ruby my most valiant and rebelious pupil"
    p "I get that you will never listen to me but why do you have to drag Mina into your nonsense"
    p "I don't mind dealing with you since you've been a problem ever since your first year"
    p "But Mina, Is a bright student with a very great future ahead of him"
    p "But he keeps falling back due to his love for you as a friend"
    p "And what do you do... bring her down to your level"

    "What does he know?"
    "The only reason Mina does all of this is because she loves me"
    "And you think I'd let you come in between that"
    "Matter of fact even her boyfriend, no one can come between us even if they tried"
    "Only I truly love her"

    p "This is'nt the time to be zoning out, I'm looking out for you both but more especially Mina so please do not try to disturb him in any way"

    r "Your wish is my command"

    p "You are excused"

    "Finally"
    "I can finally leave this class"
    

    
